{"version":1,"content":"<p>遊戲界神作《GTA 6》（Grand Theft Auto VI）近日瘋魔全球，推出首日銷售額已高達38億美元（約296.4億港元）破盡史上最高電視遊戲銷售單日紀錄。</p><p>「GTA迷」亦於遊戲中發現大量「彩蛋」向不少經典電影角色致敬。</p><p>&lt;br</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T03:23:55.811547+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":119,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T03:01:11+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T03:17:14.567392+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T03:17:14.567392+00:00","content_hash":"9860e0a13c0fcceb5998b0d91c67d5f8e9bf294018b1769699272cadf5991de1","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}